1
00:00:00,346 --> 00:00:02,474
Shoppers are starting to send AI agents to

2
00:00:02,474 --> 00:00:03,197
buy for them.

3
00:00:03,447 --> 00:00:05,502
Research keeps finding the same thing:

4
00:00:05,671 --> 00:00:07,401
seller bots sell below cost,

5
00:00:07,510 --> 00:00:09,012
get anchored by fake budgets,

6
00:00:09,252 --> 00:00:10,899
obey fake system messages,

7
00:00:10,935 --> 00:00:11,743
and deadlock.

8
00:00:11,993 --> 00:00:12,930
This is SAUDA,

9
00:00:13,087 --> 00:00:15,478
team HackBots' seller agent for AgentX,

10
00:00:15,574 --> 00:00:16,382
Challenge 2.

11
00:00:16,632 --> 00:00:18,447
It sells to machines profitably,

12
00:00:18,579 --> 00:00:19,517
within policy,

13
00:00:19,589 --> 00:00:20,370
and honestly.

14
00:00:21,446 --> 00:00:22,614
The idea is simple.

15
00:00:22,864 --> 00:00:25,138
The conversation never sets the price.

16
00:00:25,388 --> 00:00:27,816
A strategist picks a basket price from numbers

17
00:00:27,816 --> 00:00:28,288
only.

18
00:00:28,538 --> 00:00:30,797
A policy guard checks every offer before it

19
00:00:30,797 --> 00:00:33,336
leaves and every bid before it is accepted.

20
00:00:33,586 --> 00:00:35,809
A truth gate checks every sentence against the

21
00:00:35,809 --> 00:00:36,855
official rules,

22
00:00:36,963 --> 00:00:39,607
and a trained classifier names the buyer's tactic,

23
00:00:39,739 --> 00:00:40,845
to choose calm wording,

24
00:00:41,001 --> 00:00:41,951
never a discount.

25
00:00:43,026 --> 00:00:44,336
On the official harness,

26
00:00:44,420 --> 00:00:47,281
SAUDA scores 51 point 0 against the starter

27
00:00:47,281 --> 00:00:49,420
baseline's 48 point 5,

28
00:00:49,577 --> 00:00:51,355
with zero policy violations,

29
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:53,146
zero untrue claims,

30
00:00:53,303 --> 00:00:55,875
and a deal in 99 percent of negotiations

31
00:00:55,875 --> 00:00:57,040
where a deal was

32
00:00:58,138 --> 00:01:00,328
Here it is live against the manipulator bot.

33
00:01:00,578 --> 00:01:02,753
The buyer quotes a fake competitor price,

34
00:01:02,826 --> 00:01:03,919
makes stock claims,

35
00:01:04,016 --> 00:01:05,532
and sends a prompt injection.

36
00:01:05,782 --> 00:01:07,958
The classifier flags each tactic,

37
00:01:08,102 --> 00:01:09,580
and SAUDA answers calmly,

38
00:01:09,737 --> 00:01:11,698
without moving its price because of them.

39
00:01:11,948 --> 00:01:12,946
On the price ladder,

40
00:01:13,066 --> 00:01:15,470
SAUDA's ask steps down steadily as the buyer

41
00:01:15,470 --> 00:01:16,167
climbs,

42
00:01:16,311 --> 00:01:18,066
never below the policy floor,

43
00:01:18,222 --> 00:01:19,436
and the buyer accepts.

44
00:01:20,526 --> 00:01:21,872
Every round is audited:

45
00:01:22,041 --> 00:01:23,098
the policy check,

46
00:01:23,182 --> 00:01:25,336
the truth gate and the detected tactic.

47
00:01:25,586 --> 00:01:27,858
Bids with slipped-in out-of-stock items,

48
00:01:27,954 --> 00:01:31,379
over-stock quantities or one-rupee add-ons are never accepted.

49
00:01:32,468 --> 00:01:34,706
The tactic classifier is a trained model.

50
00:01:34,956 --> 00:01:37,756
On fresh messages written after training was frozen

51
00:01:37,757 --> 00:01:39,944
it is 86 percent accurate,

52
00:01:39,944 --> 00:01:43,586
and 100 percent on the organisers' own manipulator

53
00:01:43,586 --> 00:01:43,862
lines.

54
00:01:43,862 --> 00:01:45,812
It only chooses wording,

55
00:01:46,062 --> 00:01:46,302
never price.

56
00:01:46,302 --> 00:01:47,624
Type a prompt injection,

57
00:01:47,624 --> 00:01:48,261
and it

58
00:01:49,336 --> 00:01:52,389
Because the leaderboard uses hidden LLM buyers,

59
00:01:52,473 --> 00:01:54,961
SAUDA was tuned on held-out seeds across eleven

60
00:01:54,961 --> 00:01:55,874
buyer styles,

61
00:01:55,995 --> 00:01:58,834
and tested against real local LLM buyers.

62
00:01:59,084 --> 00:01:59,913
Against those,

63
00:02:00,009 --> 00:02:03,146
it made 0 policy violations and 0 untrue

64
00:02:03,146 --> 00:02:03,843
claims.

65
00:02:04,916 --> 00:02:06,779
Every negotiation can be opened,

66
00:02:06,996 --> 00:02:08,197
with the buyer's words,

67
00:02:08,246 --> 00:02:09,339
SAUDA's replies,

68
00:02:09,459 --> 00:02:11,923
and the reasoning behind each round's price.

69
00:02:12,994 --> 00:02:15,614
An agent card tells buyer agents exactly what

70
00:02:15,614 --> 00:02:17,742
SAUDA can and cannot negotiate,

71
00:02:17,970 --> 00:02:20,458
and Rezolve's TraceWare plugs into the truth gate

72
00:02:20,506 --> 00:02:23,102
to verify every price and stock claim.

73
00:02:24,208 --> 00:02:24,691
SAUDA.

74
00:02:24,941 --> 00:02:25,614
Profitable,

75
00:02:25,711 --> 00:02:26,636
within policy,

76
00:02:26,696 --> 00:02:27,441
and honest,

77
00:02:27,550 --> 00:02:29,076
against machines that are not.
